  "base_commit": "2fce5147e68f14353fbb6d0a5c9c8d7066c6600c",
  "scope": "Native independent Explorer A task windows, per-owner input/results and minimum-width/live-font layout. This does not close full visual fidelity or the whole dialog conversion.",
  "implementation": [
    "Independent SDL/GL/Nuklear/worker state per request route, separate embedded files context, explicit picker UI in drawing/API helpers, immutable shared fonts.",
    "Main and detached input/layout no longer globally blocked by an open selection; B only waits for its own child. Reinvoke preserves form; result/cancel/project changes remain generation and source scoped.",
    "Frame-boundary creation/destruction; weak source window ID checked before focus return. Source close, late reply, main project change and shutdown checked.",
    "Native component max1180 logical pixels, centered in wider client. Compact560 layout, min320 client, long folder-confirm action, live font cycles, real saved main document and detached protocol input while two pickers stay open.",
    "Places label inset/border/padding/minimum/opacity and inherited1.55 pitch match the approved scoped CSS; independent measurements reject old inset.",
    "Mandatory internal focus model survives optional native accessibility exporter failure; init fails cleanly on mandatory allocation failure and no-exporter shutdown frees the locally owned mutex. Actual native availability remains false when disabled."
  ],
